{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine the intensity of a 2D fighting game meeting the all-so-British elegance and sense of mastery of a Cricket match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's Super Cricket Fighter Turbo! A pixelated 1v1 arcade game where two players are clashing on the same screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a good friend, start a match, and FIGHT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse, keyboard, or gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail-biting hard AI players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Coop Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy 8-bit art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated insult button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nothing like real cricket, but it's fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Cricket Fighter Turbo is a PC remaster of the first game we ever received a review for, 10 years ago~  <br>It was delisted from mobile stores over time, and we wanted to bring it back for that special occasion. <br>We hope you enjoy it as much as we enjoyed working on it!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Catch it if you can","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522620/23ad5de171566d6df7d7dc85cfe8db734467d405.jpg"},{"name":"It's the taking part that counts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522620/23ad5de171566d6df7d7dc85cfe8db734467d405.jpg"},{"name":"OUHHHHH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522620/9ddec49c0e6efc9d2adfdba223b2cf23c041df98.jpg"},{"name":"Wall of Sound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522620/9ddec49c0e6efc9d2adfdba223b2cf23c041df98.jpg"},{"name":"Hold your breath","path":"https://cdn.akam